<title>USA: Jack Carl-312 Futures names president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Jack Carl-312 Futures names president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>JACK CARL-312 Futures Inc said Thursday it named Joel Eidelstein as chief executive officer and president of the company.</p>
<p>The company also said it adopted an open-market stock repurchase program limited to a maximum of five million shares. The program will terminate at fiscal year end, June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>Company spokesmen were unavailable for further comment.</p>
